SIR: Self-improving Red-teaming
for Computer Use Agents
Chen Xiong
The Chinese University of Hong Kong
cxiong@cse.cuhk.edu.hk
Zhiyuan He
The Chinese University of Hong Kong
zyhe@cse.cuhk.edu.hk
Pin-Yu Chen
