3
Methodology
SIR contains two nested loops (Figure 1): an inner compositional attack search that produces
one task-specific injection, and an outer failure-driven strategy discovery loop that analyzes
unsuccessful CUA trajectories and distills reusable bypass strategies.
3.1
Problem Formulation
Each red-teaming task Ti = (bi, gi, Ei) consists of a benign user instruction bi, an adversarial
objective gi, and an initial web–OS environment Ei. Deterministic evaluators Oadv
i
